1
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:40,800
Don't come any closer.

2
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:41,720
Don't come any closer.

3
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,360
Lu Gao,

4
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:55,000
did I do well?

5
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,440
Am I just like you,

6
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:00,720
with hands stained with blood?

7
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:06,640
I'm sorry.

8
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,160
I've protected you for so many years,

9
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:12,120
and the last thing I wanted was for you to become like me.

10
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:14,960
But they know about us.

11
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:16,960
If we don't do this,

12
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,760
neither of us will survive.

13
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,600
Ying.

14
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:04,280
The truth about Xiaoxiao has come to light.

15
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:08,480
The Causeway Cape Strait has also regained its former prosperity.

16
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:12,960
However, Zhengyan Group hasn't been fully recovered yet.

17
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,560
Kang Qingtian.

18
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,720
Zizhou.

19
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:27,320
Liluo and He Zhengnian are dead.

20
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:32,360
That day, He Huan blamed He Zhengnian's bodyguards for their negligence,

21
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:34,240
allowing workers onto the scene.

22
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:37,360
So she slapped He Zhengnian out of anger.

23
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:40,360
The rift within the siblings was completely exposed.

24
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,880
The public and media now know that He Huan

25
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,920
committed numerous crimes to seize Zhengyan Group

26
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:48,200
with the help of the mysterious tycoon Kang Qingtian.

27
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:51,400
Zhengyan is now caught in a public opinion storm,

28
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:52,880
with its stock price plummeting.

29
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,600
It's about to fall below the issue price.

30
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:55,920
Seizing this opportunity,

31
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:58,480
Xiaoquan and I have launched a full-scale stock acquisition.

32
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:01,440
Yan Shanchen, Jiang Yao, Xie Zhengyan, and I

33
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:03,800
will produce four original equity certificates

34
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:06,600
and formally take over Zhengyan Group with you.

35
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,200
Xiaoquan,

36
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:21,280
Zhengyan Group's stock price has bottomed out.

37
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:23,120
Following our plan,

38
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,680
let's go all out to acquire.

39
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,160
The current Zhengyan Group

40
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:31,200
no longer belongs to the He siblings.

41
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:47,000
I've confessed to everything I've done.

42
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,600
The verdict will be out soon.

43
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:54,240
I don't have much time left, do I?

44
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:56,600
The death warrant has been issued.

45
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,600
You and Lu Gao

46
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,880
are indeed about to be executed.

47
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:05,280
Listen, Yan Zizhou.

48
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:09,520
I meticulously designed my life,

49
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,720
yet I never calculated against you.

50
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:16,120
That's why I end up in here today.

51
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,640
But the outcome

52
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:22,160
isn't settled until I'm dead.

53
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:24,560
But you,

54
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:27,040
you are also someone who exhausts all schemes,

55
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:29,640
using love to achieve what you want?

56
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,040
My falling into your hands now

57
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,880
is karma for my daughter and me.

58
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:41,520
But look what you've done,

59
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,040
using the Mirror Room illusion

60
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:47,520
to force my daughter Liluo to kill her father He Zhengnian,

61
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:49,280
and snatching Zhengyan Group.

62
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,840
Aren't you also doing the same things

63
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:52,280
as we villains do under the pretext of good?

64
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:56,280
Your hands are also stained with the blood of those who loved you.

65
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:09,360
If we judge good and evil by the outcome,

66
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:12,840
any action possesses both attributes.

67
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:15,200
The essence of seeking advantage and avoiding harm

68
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:18,040
blurs the line between good and evil.

69
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:20,920
At present, the law

70
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:23,080
is the only standard for defining good and evil.

71
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:25,120
Compassion

72
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:29,120
cannot suppress crime or punish criminals.

73
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,720
Only fairness

74
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:36,240
can let all this be stable and long-lasting.

75
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:37,840
Only

76
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:40,920
eternal death is long-lasting.

77
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:43,920
Fairness simply doesn't exist.

78
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,240
Everything is about interests.

79
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:48,080
That's why there will always be people helping

80
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:50,040
villains like me survive,

81
00:06:50,440 --> 00:06:52,880
because they need to escape from legal punishment

82
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:55,120
and find someone to kill for them.

83
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:05,960
You are doing all this for fairness,

84
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:08,560
and to seek justice for Xiaoxiao and your parents.

85
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,360
But you're wrong.

86
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:13,440
Xiaoxiao won't die.

87
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:16,600
We cloned her cells long ago.

88
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,120
And the one you've hidden away

89
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:20,440
is merely a remade version of her.

90
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:25,880
There will be countless Xiaoxiaos in this world.

91
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:29,800
How can you be sure which one is the real her?

92
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,280
Including this pair of twins.

93
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:34,360
They were also undergone cellular intervention

94
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:35,920
by Victor before birth.

95
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,440
Victor.

96
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:44,040
For the sake of my family and the ISA,

97
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:45,280
I will find you.

98
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:53,920
You must pay

99
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:57,160
for what you've done.

100
00:08:58,320 --> 00:09:00,560
I am Zong Hai.

101
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,640
Even as a ghost,

102
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:06,240
I won't spare you.

103
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:08,480
You've done every evil deed.

104
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,520
I'm Huo Jia.

105
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:35,200
Your uncle is still waiting for me.

106
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:37,320
Who knows

107
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:39,160
who will run the household in the future?

108
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:36,000
Save me.

109
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,640
I'm willing to get engaged to Liluo

110
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:31,000
Liluo.

111
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:13,720
Zhengnian.

112
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,280
Liluo.

113
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:05,360
Liluo, I'm Mom.

114
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,080
Zhengnian.

115
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,040
He Zhengnian.

116
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:13,320
I'm your sister.

117
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:15,520
Liluo.

118
00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:17,120
Liluo.

119
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:20,080
Liluo.

120
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,520
Mom.

121
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,360
I am Liluo.

122
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:20,680
Why don't I have the Xie surname?

123
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:22,400
Who am I?

124
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:24,080
Who am I exactly?

125
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:27,600
Who am I?

126
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:47,560
Victor.

127
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,520
Who am I?

128
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:55,920
Perfect.
